   "title": "General term",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&a=x^2,\\ \\ b=\\dfrac y2,\\ \\ n=10\\\\[5pt]&T_{r+1}=\\binom{10}{r}(x^2)^{10-r}\\left(\\dfrac y2\\right)^{r}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
