   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Simplify",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&T_8=\\dfrac{120}{128}\\,x^6y^7=\\dfrac{15}{16}\\,x^6y^7\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{\\text{coefficient}=\\dfrac{15}{16}}}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Reading: coefficient means the numerical}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{factor; the whole term is (15/16) $x^{6}$}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{$y^{7}$.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
